Impero is a computervision app that uses your webcam to track your hand.
It uses opencv for computervision and customtkinter for the interface.

It has 2 modes:
- mouse mode, it acts as a mouse (move index finger, click by touching middle and index finger, zoom with index and thumb, volume controll with full hand)
- iot mode, this will make the possibility to assign certain actions of a robot to hand gestures

File structure:
- main.py = starts app
- tracking.py = tracks hand movements
- actions.py = uses tracking data for actions
- gui.py = interface using CustomTkinter